			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"澤維爾"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 721221101,
					"content": "這裡「祟神」的密度也已經下降到了無害的程度…看來「御影爐心」確實已經運轉了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721221102
					],
					"speakerTitle": "澤維爾"
				},
				{
					"id": 721221102,
					"content": "如果那群愚人眾還想要「祟神」，唯一的辦法，就是用外面的大炮直接轟擊「御影爐心」了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721221103
					],
					"speakerTitle": "澤維爾"
				},
				{
					"id": 721221103,
					"content": "但這種行為差不多等於直接宣戰了，就算愚人眾再瘋，應該也不會採取這種行為吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721221104,
						721221105
					],
					"speakerTitle": "澤維爾"
				},
				{
					"id": 721221104,
					"content": "希望如此。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721221108
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 721221108,
					"content": "無論如何，現在「御影爐心」已經安全了，這座島上的我們和寶藏也不會一起被炸上天了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721221109,
						721221111
					],
					"speakerTitle": "澤維爾"
				},
				{
					"id": 721221109,
					"content": "我很期待「踏鞴物語」。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721221110
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 721221110,
					"content": "哈哈哈，在這部「映影」裡，我一定會好好復原您的形象。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721221113
					],
					"speakerTitle": "澤維爾"
				},
				{
					"id": 721221113,
					"content": "但在那之前，我也許還得先製作幾部短片練練手。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721221114
					],
					"speakerTitle": "澤維爾"
				},
				{
					"id": 721221114,
					"content": "不過這些都是後話了。那位叫做虎之助的士兵先生曾經承諾過我，只要我處理好了這件事，就會給我「相襯的報酬」…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721221115
					],
					"speakerTitle": "澤維爾"
				},
				{
					"id": 721221115,
					"content": "我們現在就回去，向那位士兵先生討一下那份「相稱的報酬」吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "澤維爾"
				},
				{
					"id": 721221111,
					"content": "你真的會製作「踏鞴物語」嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721221112
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 721221112,
					"content": "那當然了。但在正式開始製作「踏鞴物語」之前，我得先好好做些準備。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721221113
					],
					"speakerTitle": "澤維爾"
				},
				{
					"id": 721221105,
					"content": "但他們採取過。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721221106
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 721221106,
					"content": "您是說之前他們在璃月和蒙德搞的那些事嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721221107
					],
					"speakerTitle": "澤維爾"
				},
				{
					"id": 721221107,
					"content": "我是覺得，以「御影爐心」的價值，應該還不值得他們下那種狠手…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721221108
					],
					"speakerTitle": "澤維爾"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 7212212,
			"completionStepIds": [
				7212217
			],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_A_AND_ETCOR",
				"conditions": [
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"7212217",
							"2"
						],
						"stepId": 7212217,
						"stateName": "QUEST_STATE_UNFINISHED"
					},
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_QUEST_GLOBAL_VAR_LESS",
						"rawParams": [
							"202201",
							"1"
						]
					},
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_QUEST_GLOBAL_VAR_GREATER",
						"rawParams": [
							"202201",
							"1"
						]
					}
				]
			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"虎之助"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 721221201,
					"content": "「御影爐心」已經恢復正常了嗎…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721221202
					],
					"speakerTitle": "虎之助"
				},
				{
					"id": 721221202,
					"content": "你已經知道了？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721221203
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 721221203,
					"content": "你們在「御影爐心」所做的事，已經有人向我報告過了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721221204,
						721221206
					],
					"speakerTitle": "虎之助"
				},
				{
					"id": 721221204,
					"content": "為什麼不直接來幫忙？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721221205
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 721221205,
					"content": "沒有接到範兵衛大人的命令，我無權採取任何行動。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721221208
					],
					"speakerTitle": "虎之助"
				},
				{
					"id": 721221208,
					"content": "好了好了，有這麼一位對流程如此重視的嚴謹上司，這位士兵先生也有他自己的苦衷，我們就別為難他了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721221209
					],
					"speakerTitle": "澤維爾"
				},
				{
					"id": 721221209,
					"content": "再說，我倆的行動之所以能如此順利，說不定也有一部分是拜這位範兵衛先生所賜呢。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721221210
					],
					"speakerTitle": "澤維爾"
				},
				{
					"id": 721221210,
					"content": "而且士兵先生也不是完全沒有給我們幫助，比如那幾門…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721221211
					],
					"speakerTitle": "澤維爾"
				},
				{
					"id": 721221211,
					"content": "澤維爾先生，非常感謝你的協助。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721221212
					],
					"speakerTitle": "虎之助"
				},
				{
					"id": 721221212,
					"content": "咳…主要還是得感謝這位旅行者，沒有這位旅行者幫忙，我一個人可什麼都做不到。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721221213
					],
					"speakerTitle": "澤維爾"
				},
				{
					"id": 721221213,
					"content": "是這樣嗎…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721221214
					],
					"speakerTitle": "虎之助"
				},
				{
					"id": 721221214,
					"content": "#非常感謝{F#妳}{M#你}，旅行者。我為我之前的態度…向{F#妳}{M#你}道歉。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721221215
					],
					"speakerTitle": "虎之助"
				},
				{
					"id": 721221215,
					"content": "#謝謝{F#妳}{M#你}保護了這座島。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721221216,
						721221217
					],
					"speakerTitle": "虎之助"
				},
				{
					"id": 721221216,
					"content": "不用客氣。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721221218
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 721221218,
					"content": "您也別謙虛了，要是沒您幫忙，我應該就只能在外面乾看著啦。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721221219
					],
					"speakerTitle": "澤維爾"
				},
				{
					"id": 721221219,
					"content": "不過，我倒是還有個問題，士兵先生。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721221220
					],
					"speakerTitle": "澤維爾"
				},
				{
					"id": 721221220,
					"content": "您之前和我說，您那位嚴謹的上司為了遞交那些繁複的文書，不得不前往城內工作，想必肯定十分勞苦。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721221221
					],
					"speakerTitle": "澤維爾"
				},
				{
					"id": 721221221,
					"content": "但現在「御影爐心」已經恢復了正常，不知道這位好先生現在…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721221222
					],
					"speakerTitle": "澤維爾"
				},
				{
					"id": 721221222,
					"content": "唔，範兵衛大人所忙碌之事，先前就有位名叫御輿源次郎的大人詳細詢問過我。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721221223
					],
					"speakerTitle": "虎之助"
				},
				{
					"id": 721221223,
					"content": "聽了我的詳細報告之後，御輿源次郎大人似乎對這件事也很感興趣。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721221224
					],
					"speakerTitle": "虎之助"
				},
				{
					"id": 721221224,
					"content": "之後，據御輿源次郎大人說，上面的大人們也對範兵衛大人的工作能力十分讚賞。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721221225
					],
					"speakerTitle": "虎之助"
				},
				{
					"id": 721221225,
					"content": "為了嘉獎他，似乎已經將範兵衛大人選為了駐於須彌的「遠國御用」。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721221226
					],
					"speakerTitle": "虎之助"
				},
				{
					"id": 721221226,
					"content": "據說，是常駐須彌，保障須彌與稻妻蘑菇貿易通暢的重要職位。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721221227,
						721221229
					],
					"speakerTitle": "虎之助"
				},
				{
					"id": 721221227,
					"content": "果然是重要職位。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721221228
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 721221228,
					"content": "正是如此。這樣重要的職位，實在是非範兵衛大人莫屬。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721221231
					],
					"speakerTitle": "虎之助"
				},
				{
					"id": 721221231,
					"content": "現在範兵衛大人正在城內等待任令，到了合適的時候，應該就會出發了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721221232
					],
					"speakerTitle": "虎之助"
				},
				{
					"id": 721221232,
					"content": "哎呀…這可真是太棒了。不過失去了這麼一位好先生，那這裡空缺的職位怎麼辦呢？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721221233
					],
					"speakerTitle": "澤維爾"
				},
				{
					"id": 721221233,
					"content": "我已經向上面舉薦了幾位堪當此任的人。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721221234
					],
					"speakerTitle": "虎之助"
				},
				{
					"id": 721221234,
					"content": "上面的大人最後選定了一位名叫陽介的工匠，負責統一安排「御影爐心」之後的維護工作。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721221235
					],
					"speakerTitle": "虎之助"
				},
				{
					"id": 721221235,
					"content": "這樣安排聽著就讓人放心。哦對了，我們先不說這個了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721221236
					],
					"speakerTitle": "澤維爾"
				},
				{
					"id": 721221236,
					"content": "士兵先生，請把我的那份報酬全都給這位旅行者吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721221237
					],
					"speakerTitle": "澤維爾"
				},
				{
					"id": 721221237,
					"content": "#還有，這個東西請{F#妳}{M#你}收下，旅行者。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721221238
					],
					"speakerTitle": "澤維爾"
				},
				{
					"id": 721221238,
					"content": "這是我之前從一位工匠的手裡買下來的一份圖紙。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721221239
					],
					"speakerTitle": "澤維爾"
				},
				{
					"id": 721221239,
					"content": "本來我是想，把這份圖紙作為紀念品帶回國…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721221240
					],
					"speakerTitle": "澤維爾"
				},
				{
					"id": 721221240,
					"content": "但現在看來，我應該還會在稻妻停留一段時間…暫時是沒法回國了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721221241
					],
					"speakerTitle": "澤維爾"
				},
				{
					"id": 721221241,
					"content": "所以，這份圖紙我就送給您了，請您收好。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721221242
					],
					"speakerTitle": "澤維爾"
				},
				{
					"id": 721221242,
					"content": "謝謝。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721221243
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 721221243,
					"content": "哈哈哈，您不用和我這麼客氣。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721221244
					],
					"speakerTitle": "澤維爾"
				},
				{
					"id": 721221244,
					"content": "這次多謝您幫忙了。等我完成了那部「踏鞴物語」，一定第一個請您過來觀影。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721221245
					],
					"speakerTitle": "澤維爾"
				},
				{
					"id": 721221245,
					"content": "然後，士兵先生，我還有一個小小的忙，想要請你幫…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "澤維爾"
				},
				{
					"id": 721221229,
					"content": "原來是負責給稻妻添蘑菇嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721221230
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 721221230,
					"content": "正是。給稻妻人的餐桌上添蘑菇這種重要工作，實在是非範兵衛大人莫屬。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721221231
					],
					"speakerTitle": "虎之助"
				},
				{
					"id": 721221217,
					"content": "這是我應該做的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721221218
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 721221206,
					"content": "就這麼放任愚人眾嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721221207
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 721221207,
					"content": "沒有接到範兵衛大人的命令，我無權採取任何行動。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721221208
					],
					"speakerTitle": "虎之助"
				}
			]
		},
